sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client cookie jar
  participant E as ESTS
  C->>E: GET authorize (no cookies)
  E-->>C: Set-Cookie buid, esctx, esctx-A, fpc, stsservicecookie,<br/>x-ms-gateway-slice
  C->>E: GetCredentialType / GetOneTimeCode / DeviceCodeStatus (jar<br/>returned)
  E-->>C: Set-Cookie fpc, x-ms-gateway-slice
  C->>E: POST login (password or Remote NGC)
  E-->>C: Set-Cookie ESTSAUTH, ESTSAUTHPERSISTENT, ESTSAUTHLIGHT, new<br/>buid, esctx, esctx-B
  Note over E,C: delete esctx-A (empty value, past expiry)<br/>Remote NGC: also CCState, SignInStateCookie (code issued)
  Note over C,E: Password path: these are present before MFA completes<br/>and are not proof of authentication
  C->>E: SAS BeginAuth / EndAuth polls (jar returned)
  E-->>C: Set-Cookie fpc, x-ms-gateway-slice
  C->>E: POST ProcessAuth
  E-->>C: re-issue ESTSAUTH*, buid, esctx, esctx-C
  Note over E,C: delete esctx-B
  C->>E: POST resume
  E-->>C: re-issue auth cookies, CCState, SignInStateCookie
  Note over E,C: delete esctx-C, 302 with code
  C->>E: POST /{tenant}/oauth2/token
  E-->>C: Set-Cookie fpc, x-ms-gateway-slice only
